{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"horse","model_identifier":"horse","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# horse\n\nHorse (B1), sturdy medieval riding horse, 1.6 m at the withers (57 u), about 2.4 m nose to tail.\n\nDeep barrel body with chest, withers and croup blocks; neck and head as two bones (cubes pre-tilted so the rest pose is a natural head carriage); stacked mane and forelock, two-bone tail (dock + hair); four legs with two joints each (forearm/thigh, cannon, hoof). Bay coat by default with black points, blaze on the face.\n\n- Cubes: 25 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 128x128, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -8.4..8.4, y 0.0..76.0, z -54.5..31.0 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- body box 16 x 57 x 58 (w x h x d) centred on x = 0, z = -2, from y = 0; head and neck up to y = 77, z = -62\n- rearing: about 16 x 95 x 40 around the hind feet\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `idle` | 4 | loop | breathing, head and tail sway |\n| `walk` | 1.1 | loop | 4-beat walk |\n| `trot` | 0.7 | loop | diagonal 2-beat trot, short suspension |\n| `run` | 0.58 | loop | canter/slow gallop (normal run) |\n| `gallop` | 0.46 | loop | full gallop = charge speed, neck stretched |\n| `pull` | 1.4 | loop | slow walk leaning into a harness (use with horse_harness / slot_harness) |\n| `graze` | 4.5 | loop | muzzle on the grass, chewing nods, one front step (loop) |\n| `rear` | 1.8 | once | spooked / killed: rears to 40 degrees at 0.75 s, paws the air, back down by 1.8 s (once) |\n| `injured` | 0.6 | once | flinch back |\n| `death` | 1.6 | hold | buckles and falls onto its right side, holds; rests on y = 0 |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 56.9 u/s (1.6 m/s), cycle 1.1 s, 63 u per cycle\n- `trot`: 120.9 u/s (3.4 m/s), cycle 0.7 s, 85 u per cycle\n- `run`: 231.1 u/s (6.5 m/s), cycle 0.58 s, 134 u per cycle\n- `gallop`: 426.7 u/s (12.0 m/s), cycle 0.46 s, 196 u per cycle\n- `pull`: 39.1 u/s (1.1 m/s), cycle 1.4 s, 55 u per cycle\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `slot_rider` on `body` at (0, 55, -2)\n- `slot_harness` on `body` at (0, 44, -30)\n\n## Variant textures (same UV layout)\n\n- `horse_chestnut.png`: red-chestnut with flaxen-red mane\n- `horse_grey.png`: grey with pale mane\n- `horse_black.png`: black\n- `horse_wild.png`: wild dun, dark rough mane and dun points, no blaze\n- `horse_foal.png`: young texture (use at half scale): light soft coat\n\n## Notes\n\n- Neck, mane, skull, muzzle cubes carry a fixed cube rotation (neck -38 deg, head -52 deg about their bone pivots); everything else is unrotated.\n- slot_rider is the saddle seat; horse_tack and horse_harness are separate models with the same bone names, bind them to the horse skeleton so they follow every clip.\n- Trot / run / gallop have suspension phases where all hooves leave the ground (by design).\n"},"description":"# horse\n\nHorse (B1), sturdy medieval riding horse, 1.6 m at the withers (57 u), about 2.4 m nose to tail.\n\nDeep barrel body with chest, withers and croup blocks; neck and head as two bones (cubes pre-tilted so the rest pose is a natural head carriage); stacked mane and forelock, two-bone tail (dock + hair); four legs with two joints each (forearm/thigh, cannon, hoof). Bay coat by default with black points, blaze on the face.\n\n- Cubes: 25 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 128x128, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -8.4..8.4, y 0.0..76.0, z -54.5..31.0 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- body box 16 x 57 x 58 (w x h x d) centred on x = 0, z = -2, from y = 0; head and neck up to y = 77, z = -62\n- rearing: about 16 x 95 x 40 around the hind feet\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `idle` | 4 | loop | breathing, head and tail sway |\n| `walk` | 1.1 | loop | 4-beat walk |\n| `trot` | 0.7 | loop | diagonal 2-beat trot, short suspension |\n| `run` | 0.58 | loop | canter/slow gallop (normal run) |\n| `gallop` | 0.46 | loop | full gallop = charge speed, neck stretched |\n| `pull` | 1.4 | loop | slow walk leaning into a harness (use with horse_harness / slot_harness) |\n| `graze` | 4.5 | loop | muzzle on the grass, chewing nods, one front step (loop) |\n| `rear` | 1.8 | once | spooked / killed: rears to 40 degrees at 0.75 s, paws the air, back down by 1.8 s (once) |\n| `injured` | 0.6 | once | flinch back |\n| `death` | 1.6 | hold | buckles and falls onto its right side, holds; rests on y = 0 |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 56.9 u/s (1.6 m/s), cycle 1.1 s, 63 u per cycle\n- `trot`: 120.9 u/s (3.4 m/s), cycle 0.7 s, 85 u per cycle\n- `run`: 231.1 u/s (6.5 m/s), cycle 0.58 s, 134 u per cycle\n- `gallop`: 426.7 u/s (12.0 m/s), cycle 0.46 s, 196 u per cycle\n- `pull`: 39.1 u/s (1.1 m/s), cycle 1.4 s, 55 u per cycle\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `slot_rider` on `body` at (0, 55, -2)\n- `slot_harness` on `body` at (0, 44, -30)\n\n## Variant textures (same UV layout)\n\n- `horse_chestnut.png`: red-chestnut with flaxen-red mane\n- `horse_grey.png`: grey with pale mane\n- `horse_black.png`: black\n- `horse_wild.png`: wild dun, dark rough mane and dun points, no blaze\n- `horse_foal.png`: young texture (use at half scale): light soft coat\n\n## Notes\n\n- Neck, mane, skull, muzzle cubes carry a fixed cube rotation (neck -38 deg, head -52 deg about their bone pivots); everything else is unrotated.\n- slot_rider is the saddle seat; horse_tack and horse_harness are separate models with the same bone names, bind them to the horse skeleton so they follow every clip.\n- Trot / run / gallop have suspension phases where all hooves leave the ground (by design).\n","resolution":{"width":128,"height":256},"elements":